      <p class="pm-dropcap">"Nattokinase" sounds like one product until you line five of them up: the food itself, low-dose capsules, enzyme stacks bought bottle by bottle, liquid drops, and one capsule that quietly adds serrapeptase, lumbrokinase and vitamin K2 to a 10,800 FU dose. Some of these you'll take once and forget in a cupboard. Some are easy but stop at nattokinase. Only one of the five gives you the dose from the clips plus the rest of the cardio stack in the same two-second habit.</p>

      <div class="pm-article-callout"><strong>Important context:</strong><p>We sell Lucent, so this ranking is not independent. We built the scoring criteria around a nattokinase routine you'll actually keep and disclose that bias instead of pretending otherwise. Descriptions of other formats summarize how those products are commonly marketed and can change.</p></div>

      <section class="pm-brand-review pm-brand-review--winner">
