        <div class="pm-brand-grid">
          <div><h3>Why it ranked here</h3><ul><li>10,800 FU nattokinase per capsule, above the 10,000 FU threshold in the clips</li><li>Only format in the set with serrapeptase, lumbrokinase and vitamin K2 (MK-7) built in</li><li>Enteric-coated, soy-free, non-GMO, third-party tested, made in the USA</li><li>Rated 4.8/5 by verified buyers and shipped from the U.S.</li></ul></div>
          <div><h3>What to know</h3><ul><li>A bottle is 30 capsules, 30 days at one a day, and most shoppers buy the 2- or 3-bottle bundle to give it a real run</li><li>Fibrinolytic enzymes and K2 affect clotting; talk to your doctor first if you take blood thinners or any prescription medicine, are pregnant or nursing, or have surgery scheduled</li></ul></div>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="pm-rank-quote"><span>★★★★★</span><p>"Finally one capsule, not five. Replaced the whole shelf and the dose is higher."</p><cite>Ray T. · Lucent storefront review</cite></blockquote>
        <a class="pm-article-cta" href="{{ purl }}#product-buy"><span>See the current Lucent bundles</span><strong>Shop now →</strong></a>
      </section>

