        <p>Buying nattokinase, serrapeptase, lumbrokinase and K2 individually gives you full control of every dose.</p>
        <div class="pm-review-balance"><div class="is-good"><strong>Why we like it</strong><p>Total flexibility, and you can pick the brand you trust for each enzyme.</p></div><div class="is-watch"><strong>Why Lucent ranks above it for our use case</strong><p>Four bottles, four price tags and four things to remember. Most people drop at least one within a month. Lucent puts the stack in one capsule.</p></div></div>
