      <h2>Why we put Lucent at #1</h2>
      <p>Not because every alternative is bad. Natto started the whole trend and separate bottles give real control. Lucent ranks first here because the criteria are deliberately about <strong>a nattokinase routine you'll keep for 30 days</strong>, and under that lens one enteric-coated capsule that delivers 10,800 FU and also covers serrapeptase, lumbrokinase and vitamin K2 has an inherent advantage over four products that are, at their core, nattokinase and nothing else.</p>
      <p>That's also why we disclose the methodology. If your real priority is the cheapest capsule on the shelf, the ranking changes.</p>

